        "PMC7512559::chunk::001::introduction::316f02dec2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The initial multilayer has no significant phase segregation.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Doping or compositional adjustment between adjacent layers can systematically control lattice mismatch.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed compositional variation can produce interfaces ranging from coherent to semi-coherent or incoherent.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A temperature range of 500–600 °C is an intermediate-temperature creep regime for this multilayer system.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent interfaces promote diffusion pathways.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent interfaces enhance diffusion-based creep.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Semi-coherent or incoherent interfaces facilitate dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower applied stresses produce a creep exponent of approximately 5–6.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "More coherent interfaces produce a creep exponent of approximately 5–6.",
